orted symptom associated with diverse pharmaceutical agents in this community. It is listed as the most frequent adverse event for both SOF/SMV (29%) and 索磷布韦/来迪派韦 (28%) regimens [Data: Relationships (7862, 15123)]. Furthermore, 乏力 is also identified as a symptom of 药物依赖性, as observed in a case involving 利福平 withdrawal [Data: Entities (17832, 17249); Relationships (18595)]. Despite its high incidence, 乏力 is consistently described as mild and not leading to treatment discontinuation, suggesting it is more a nuisance than a serious clinical concern in these contexts [Data: Relationships (7862, 15123)].\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"summary\": \"盐酸洛哌丁胺 carries rare but serious gastrointestinal and neurological risks\",\n            \"explanation\": \"Although not central to the main antiviral or cytoprotective drug group, 盐酸洛哌丁胺 is included in this community due to documented severe adverse reactions. It is associated with 中枢神经系统毒性反应, particularly in patients with hepatic impairment where drug accumulation may occur [Data: Entities (7282, 15326); Relationships (14569)]. Additionally, there are case reports of 中毒性巨结肠 in HIV patients using 盐酸洛哌丁胺 for infectious colitis [Data: Entities (15334); Relationships (14570)]. These findings indicate that while 盐酸洛哌丁胺 is widely used for diarrhea, its use in specific populations requires caution and close monitoring to avoid life-threatening complications.\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"summary\": \"糖酸钙 serves as an effective therapeutic intervention for 阿米福汀-induced hypocalcemic events\",\n            \"explanation\": \"In response to 阿米福汀-induced 低钙抽搐, 糖酸钙 is indicated as a treatment with demonstrated clinical efficacy. Evidence shows that administration of 10% 糖酸钙 led to symptom resolution and normalization of blood calcium levels in affected pediatric patients [Data: Entities (7681, 17846); Relationships (23911)]. This establishes 糖酸钙 not as a primary therapeutic agent but as a critical rescue medication with